rd </em>v. <em>Hunter, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"96578\"><a href=\"/opinion/96578/ballard-v-hunter/#262\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Ballard v. Hunter\">204 U. S. 241, 262</a></span>; <em>North Laramie Land Co. </em>v. <em>Hoffman, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"100664\"><a href=\"/opinion/100664/north-laramie-land-co-v-hoffman/#283\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: North Laramie Land Co. v. Hoffman\">268 U. S. 276, 283</a></span>.</p>\n<attorneys id=\"Aar\"><em>Mr. Walter M. Schoenle </em>for appellant. <em>Mr. John D. Ellis </em>for appellees.</attorneys>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}